CVPR-2024-P0495,CVPR-2024-A002713,Yash Jain,shared,3,4,4,"University of Washington Project Webpage “A cartoon panda playing peekaboo behind bamboo” “A bald eagle flying in the blue sky” “A horse galloping through a meadow” Figure . Zero-training No-latency interactive video generation. P EEKABOO allows users to control the output (object size, location and trajectory) for any off-the-shelf video diffusion models, through specially designed masking modules. First row shows a panda playing P EEKABOO by following an expanding mask in left direction.",-4,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0495.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Jain_PEEKABOO_Interactive_Video_Generation_via_Masked-Diffusion_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
