CVPR-2024-P0497,CVPR-2024-A002721,Yu Zeng,shared,3,7,7,"Johns Hopkins University TTI-Chicago on top of a dirt road A monster Text-to-image NVIDIA Research with Eiffel tower in the background Input Input Ours ✅ Diverse results ✅ Preserve input subject DreamBooth ❌ Overfit to input reading a newspaper Ours ✅ Diverse results ✅ Preserve input subject BLIPDiffusion ❌ Different subject in chef outfit sleeping by a frozen pond DreamBooth ❌ Overfit to input ❌ Poor input preservation BLIPDiffusion ❌ Poor input preservation on a cobblestone street under a starry night floating in water A cat boss in front of a castle A cat astronaut in green cloak in Sherlock Holmes movie in leather jacket a red cow sculpture like a tile mosaic on pink fabric on wooden floor in Grand Canyon A mouse A cow sculpture Figure . We present Joint-Image Diffusion (JeDi), a finetuning-free image personalization model that can operate on any number of reference images. JeDi is able to preserve the appearance of custom subjects while generating novel variations. As shown in the top row, JeDi does not suffer from the issues of overfitting and lack of diversity exhibited by the prior models. The examples in the bottom two rows demonstrate JeDi’s high-quality results on challenging personalization tasks.",-14,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0497.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Zeng_JeDi_Joint-Image_Diffusion_Models_for_Finetuning-Free_Personalized_Text-to-Image_Generation_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
