CVPR-2024-P0553,CVPR-2024-A003032,Xudong Wang,shared,3,5,5,"code: Image Caption: An image depicting in the morning. A brown cute teddy bear, a purple cute teddy bear, a yellow cute teddy bear, a blue cute teddy bear all standing side by side on a red brick road. The scene should be set in front of Pink Castle with clear blue sky overhead, punctuated by ﬂuffy white clouds, and trees with green leaves. The pink castle should loom majestically in the background. Instance Captions: - ) A brown/purple/yellow/blue teddy bear; ) a red brick road; ) Pink Castle; - ) green leaves; - ) ﬂuffy white clouds Image Caption: Craft an oil painting: Picture a seaside garden drenched in radiant hues of roses, lilies, and lavender, transitioning gracefully into the expansive azure ocean and blue sky. Integrate a weathered, rustic pathway with steps that invite viewers towards the water's edge, complemented by a prominent bouquet of ﬂowers and plants. Instance Captions: - ) roses; ) sky; ) ocean; ) pathway with steps; ) bouquet of ﬂowers; ) plant; - ) plants a) Diverse Instance Attributes and Locations b) Dense Small Objects Hierarchy Eagle Head Beak Image Caption: An image of two little husky puppy in a wicker basket. Instance Captions: ) a husky puppy sitting in a wicker basket + Mask. ) a black and white husky puppy in a blue towel + Box. ) two husky puppies sitting in a wicker basket + Scribble. ) a blue towel + Point Image Caption: A golden eagle perched on a rugged rock. Instance Caption: - ) A golden eagle; - ) Eagle’s head; - ) Eagle’s beak c) Various Location Conditions (box, mask, scribble, point) d) Image Composition with Whole Instance, Part and Subpart Figure . InstanceDiffusion’s generations using instance-level text prompts and location conditions for image generation. Our model can respect: a) a variety of instances with diverse attributes ( colors) and boxes, b) densely-packed instances (> objects), c) mixed location conditions (such as boxes, masks, scribbles, and points), and d) compositions with granularity spanning from entire instances to parts and subparts. The positioning of parts/subparts implicitly alters the overall pose of the object. The instance inputs and their global text prompts are displayed, with the location conditions displayed on the left image. Numbers in the box/mask/scribble/point refer to the instance id.",-6,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0553.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Wang_InstanceDiffusion_Instance-level_Control_for_Image_Generation_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
