CVPR-2024-P0635,CVPR-2024-A003488,Yiqun Mei,shared,3,9,9,"Adobe Inc. (a) Relighting and Viewpoint Control Input (b) Head Pose Control (c) Shadow Diffusion Figure . Holo-Relighting performs volumetric relighting on a single input portrait image, allowing users to individually control ( ) lighting effect via an environment map, ( ) camera viewpoint and ( ) head pose. It is highly expressive and can render complex illumination effects on in-the-wild human faces with accurate view consistency (a). Controls are well disentangled to produce a realistic rendering of moving shadows cast by a point light while rotating the head (b). Practical photographic applications such as shadow diffusion (softening) are also made feasible with our system (c).",-4,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0635.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Mei_Holo-Relighting_Controllable_Volumetric_Portrait_Relighting_from_a_Single_Image_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
