CVPR-2024-P0711,CVPR-2024-A003955,Ziqiao Peng,shared,3,9,9,"Renmin University of China Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications Psyche AI Inc. Chinese Academy of Sciences Tsinghua University Speech Reference Face-Sync Controller Generated SyncTalk >>> + >>> Reference Tri-Plane Hash Representation Features: Lip Sync >>> Head-Sync Stabilizer ER-NeRF Ours Portrait-Sync Generator Expression Control >>> Pose Stable High Resolution Figure . The proposed SyncTalk synthesizes synchronized talking head videos, employing tri-plane hash representations to maintain subject identity. It can generate synchronized lip movements, facial expressions, and stable head poses, and restores hair details to create high-resolution videos.",-15,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0711.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Peng_SyncTalk_The_Devil_is_in_the_Synchronization_for_Talking_Head_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
