CVPR-2024-P0853,CVPR-2024-A004735,Wenbo Wang,shared,3,8,8,"Department of Computer Science, ETH Zürich Max Planck Institute for Intelligent Systems, Tübingen Figure . Overview of 4D-DRESS. We propose the first real-world 4D dataset of human clothing, capturing human outfits in more than motion sequences. These sequences include a) high-quality 4D textured scans; for each scan, we annotate b) vertex-level semantic labels, thereby obtaining c) the corresponding garment meshes and fitted SMPL(-X) body meshes.",2,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0853.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Wang_4D-DRESS_A_4D_Dataset_of_Real-World_Human_Clothing_With_Semantic_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
