CVPR-2024-P0867,CVPR-2024-A004803,Xiangyue Liu,shared,3,5,5,"Output Output Output Input Input zoom in Output Output zoom in Input Output Output Output View View View View Inpainting Super-resolution Input Figure . We introduce GenN2N, a uniﬁed framework for NeRF-to-NeRF translation, enabling a range of 3D NeRF editing tasks, including text-driven editing, colorization, super-resolution, inpainting, etc. We show at least two rendering views of edited NeRF scenes at inference time. Given a 3D NeRF scene, GenN2N can produce high-quality editing results with suitable multi-view consistency.",-4,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0867.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Liu_GenN2N_Generative_NeRF2NeRF_Translation_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
