CVPR-2024-P0965,CVPR-2024-A005344,Lingteng Qiu,shared,3,10,10,"SSE, CUHKSZ Dragon Flower-like Wings FNii, CUHKSZ Alibaba Group Mini China Town The Nine-tailed Fox Phoenix Fire Einstein Rides a Motorcycle Simba Lion King Age-old Dragon James Rides a Unicorn Majestic Peacock Throne Robotic Beetle Crocheted Doll with Crown Dogs Play Poker Cybernetic Raven Crocodile Play Drum Crocodile Astronaut Crocodile Chef Crocodile Warrior Crocodile LEGO Crocodile Plush Toy Figure . 3D Generation Results and Applications of RichDreamer. RichDreamer can generate highly-detailed and diverse 3D content from free-form user prompts. Our method achieves this by first generating the object geometry based on a generalizable Normal-Depth diffusion model, followed by modeling the physically-based rendering (PBR) materials. Notably, the diverse crocodile-theme objects at the bottom highlights the generalization ability of our method. The abbreviation of text prompts are shown beside the corresponding objects (full prompts can be found in the supplementary materials).",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0965.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Qiu_RichDreamer_A_Generalizable_Normal-Depth_Diffusion_Model_for_Detail_Richness_in_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
