CVPR-2024-P0996,CVPR-2024-A005511,Chaoyi Zhang,shared,3,8,8,"∫ ∂ University of Sydney Microsoft Advanced Micro Devices Figure . We present MM-Narrator, a training-free framework towards automatic audio description (AD) generation for long-form videos via iterations: for each scene, it perceives multimodal inputs (i.e., seeing visual frames and hearing character dialogues), recalls the context AD depicting past scenes, and infers AD prediction for the current scene. Zoom in for details.",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P0996.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Zhang_MM-Narrator_Narrating_Long-form_Videos_with_Multimodal_In-Context_Learning_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
