CVPR-2024-P1032,CVPR-2024-A005726,Zhi Gao,shared,3,7,7,"School of Intelligence Science and Technology, Peking University State Key Laboratory of General Artificial Intelligence, BIGAI Beijing Jiaotong University Department of Automation, Tsinghua University Tag the director of the movie Parasite. Bong Joon-ho At least one image shows an living mammal surrounded by vultures. Replace Leonardo with Dominik Sadoch. FACEDET FACEDET LIST SELECT CLASSIFY REPLACE The statement is FALSE. TAG It is not Dominik Sadoch. Tagged the wrong person. CLASSIFY fails on Bong Joon-ho. Update it. VQA Is there any windmill in the upper part of the image? no CROP VQA LOC XOR eval XOR IF eval IF The statement should be TRUE. The correct answer is yes. LOC fails on windmill. Update it. REPLACE fails on Dominik. Update it. LLMs should use OR function instead of XOR function. Update LLMs by using this as in-context examples. Bong Joon-ho Tag the best director of the 92nd Oscar. FACEDET Bong Joon-ho LIST CLASSIFY TAG (a) Update the CLASSIFY tool At least one image shows the dog with its mouth over the edge of the watermelon. Replace the lion with Dominik Sadoch. FACEDET The statement is FALSE. VQA SELECT VQA REPLACE OR eval OR (c) Update LLMs (b) Update the REPLACE tool Is there a airplane below the windmill? yes LOC LOC COUNT IF eval IF (d) Update the LOC tool Figure . CLOVA is a general visual assistant that updates both LLMs and visual tools via inference, reflection, and learning in a closedloop framework. During inference, CLOVA uses LLMs to integrate visual tools to accomplish given tasks. In reflection, CLOVA identifies tools that require updating based on human feedback. Finally, in learning, CLOVA collects data and updates the tools accordingly.",-1,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P1032.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Gao_CLOVA_A_Closed-LOop_Visual_Assistant_with_Tool_Usage_and_Update_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
CVPR-2024-P1032,CVPR-2024-A005727,Yuntao Du,shared,3,7,7,"School of Intelligence Science and Technology, Peking University State Key Laboratory of General Artificial Intelligence, BIGAI Beijing Jiaotong University Department of Automation, Tsinghua University Tag the director of the movie Parasite. Bong Joon-ho At least one image shows an living mammal surrounded by vultures. Replace Leonardo with Dominik Sadoch. FACEDET FACEDET LIST SELECT CLASSIFY REPLACE The statement is FALSE. TAG It is not Dominik Sadoch. Tagged the wrong person. CLASSIFY fails on Bong Joon-ho. Update it. VQA Is there any windmill in the upper part of the image? no CROP VQA LOC XOR eval XOR IF eval IF The statement should be TRUE. The correct answer is yes. LOC fails on windmill. Update it. REPLACE fails on Dominik. Update it. LLMs should use OR function instead of XOR function. Update LLMs by using this as in-context examples. Bong Joon-ho Tag the best director of the 92nd Oscar. FACEDET Bong Joon-ho LIST CLASSIFY TAG (a) Update the CLASSIFY tool At least one image shows the dog with its mouth over the edge of the watermelon. Replace the lion with Dominik Sadoch. FACEDET The statement is FALSE. VQA SELECT VQA REPLACE OR eval OR (c) Update LLMs (b) Update the REPLACE tool Is there a airplane below the windmill? yes LOC LOC COUNT IF eval IF (d) Update the LOC tool Figure . CLOVA is a general visual assistant that updates both LLMs and visual tools via inference, reflection, and learning in a closedloop framework. During inference, CLOVA uses LLMs to integrate visual tools to accomplish given tasks. In reflection, CLOVA identifies tools that require updating based on human feedback. Finally, in learning, CLOVA collects data and updates the tools accordingly.",-1,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P1032.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Gao_CLOVA_A_Closed-LOop_Visual_Assistant_with_Tool_Usage_and_Update_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
