CVPR-2024-P1252,CVPR-2024-A007015,Yuechen Zhang,shared,3,5,5,"Language Prompt I would like to control the degree of compactness User: Write a summary of A Mid-Summer Nights' Dream. Make it compact. Vicuna Normal Inference tokens A Midsummer Night's Dream is a comedy play written by William Shakespeare. The play follows the events that take place… Prompt Engineering MAKE IT COMPACT Unstable tokens → super compact tokens + Compactness is important. tokens Prompt Highlighter: Control Partial Prompts Vision & Language Prompt I want to know more about the man and the jersey... User: Please describe this image. LLaVA Normal Inference The image features a man wearing a red and green soccer jersey, smiling and posing for a picture. He is likely a soccer player, as he is wearing a sports uniform and is standing on a field. The man appears to be enjoying himself… Prompt Highlighter: Inference with Highlighted Region tokens In A Mid-Summer Nights' Dream, a group of young lovers, including Hermia, Lysander, Demetrius, and Helena, become… The image features a smiling man, who is none other than the famous soccer player, Cristiano Ronaldo. He is wearing a red and green jersey and is standing in front of a crowd… tokens In A Mid-Summer Nights' Dream, four young lovers run away from an arranged marriage and hide in the forest where they are controlled by a mischievous fairy. A troupe of actors perform a play within the play that resolves the conflicts and the lovers are reunited. </s> The man in the image is wearing a red, green, and yellow shirt, which is the national soccer team uniform of Portugal. He is smiling and appears to be enjoying the game. The shirt has a green and red stripe, and the number is displayed on it … Figure . Prompt Highlighter facilitates token-level user interactions for customized generation, compatible with both LLMs and VLMs. Compared with vanilla inference and prompt engineering, the context-highlighted inference provided by our method offers controllable generations and produces customized results. Outputs correlated with the highlighted parts are underlined.",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P1252.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Zhang_Prompt_Highlighter_Interactive_Control_for_Multi-Modal_LLMs_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
