CVPR-2024-P1907,CVPR-2024-A010679,Zhangyang Qi,shared,3,8,8,"The University of Hong Kong The Chinese University of Hong Kong Fudan University Shanghai Jiao Tong University Shanghai Artificial Intelligence Lab 3D Recognition 3D Captioning 3D Question Answering Point-Text Retrieval: Q1·T1 Q2·T2 QN·TN Q1 Q2 T1 a toy blue airplane T2 a 3D model of Jupiter TN a brown guitar A man wearing a red shirt and blue pants. Describe the object. What is on top of the cake? A portable, wall-mountable radio with a cord, handle, and wooden box design. QN There is a candle on top of the cake. Match What is the purpose of the cake? Hand-made Objects Anomalous Object 3D Understanding ... pPlan et airplane ... guitar guitar planet airplane The cake is meant to be a birthday cake, as indicated by the candle. The 3D object model in the image is a horse-drawn carriage, which is a type of vehicle commonly used in the past for transportation and transportation of goods the carriage is made of wood and has a classic design, with a roof and wooden wheels. What is the significance of the number on the cake? Point-Text Feature The number on the cake likely represents the age of the person celebrating their birthday. Text Is it one human face? Yes, it is a human face, Text-to-3D 选择的是 A man wearing a red Point-E multimodal model shirt and blue pants. 这个方向提交的 Elaborate on the details of this point cloud, please. specifically the face of Buddha. Is it one human face? No, it is not one human face, it is a collection of human faces. Generated Objects GPT4Point Zero-shot Classification: CLASS 3D Generation Original Low-Quality Points Is it one bear body? Yes, the image depicts a single bear body. Controlable Text-to-3D Is it one bear body? No, it is a collection of different bear bodies, each with its own unique features. Figure . Task examples of GPT4Point. It performs accurate 3D recognition, detailed captioning, precise Q&A, and high-quality controllable 3D generation. Additionally, GPT4Point excels in 3D anomalous object description, accurately assessing abnormal shapes like the multi-face object and the 3D generation failure case. It is a crucial ability in the assessment of generated 3D objects.",-7,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P1907.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Qi_GPT4Point_A_Unified_Framework_for_Point-Language_Understanding_and_Generation_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
