CVPR-2024-P1980,CVPR-2024-A011107,Cheng-You Lu,shared,3,11,11,"Brown University IIIT Hyderabad I3S-CNRS/Université Côte d’Azur /research/diva Figure . DiVa- is a real-world ◦ multi-view visual dataset of dynamic tabletop scenes captured using a customized low-cost capture system consisting of cameras. DiVa- contains diverse moving object sequences, hand-object interaction sequences, and long-duration sequences ( - mins). DiVa- provides ( ) ◦ coverage of dynamic scenes, ( ) foreground-background segmentation masks, and ( ) diverse table-scale scenes with intricate motions. DiVa- aims to facilitate research in dynamic long-duration neural fields.",-7,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P1980.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Lu_DiVa-360_The_Dynamic_Visual_Dataset_for_Immersive_Neural_Fields_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
