CVPR-2024-P2074,CVPR-2024-A011640,Chung Min Kim,shared,3,6,6,"UC Berkeley Luma AI Hierarchical Asset Extraction NeRF Multi-Level Masks Group Anything with Radiance Fields Multi-Scale Clustering Scale larger smaller Figure . Group Anything with Radiance Fields (GARField): GARField distills multi-level groups represented as masks into a NeRF to create a scale-conditioned 3D affinity field (top left). Once trained, this affinity field can be clustered at a variety of scales to decompose the scene at different levels of granularity, like breaking apart the excavator into its subparts (bottom). 3D assets can be extracted from this hierarchy by extracting every group in the scene automatically or via user clicks, as visualized here (top right).",-4,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P2074.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Kim_GARField_Group_Anything_with_Radiance_Fields_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
