CVPR-2024-P2108,CVPR-2024-A011835,Liang Xu,shared,3,13,13,"Shanghai Jiao Tong University Eastern Institute of Technology, Ningbo WeChat, Tencent Inc. Lenovo Hands: Hug, Handshake, Wave, Grab, Hit, Push, Pull, Slap, Pat, Point at, High-five, Support, Link arms, Massaging, Hand wrestling, Thumb up, Touch One person faces the other person, stretches out his/her arms and walks towards the other one, embracing the other's waist, while the other person also extends his both arms to embrace the first person's shoulders, and gently pats them. Then, the two people separate and take a step back. (Human body / Body parts / Hands / Orientation) Torso: Knock over, Bend, Carry on back, Block Head: Whisper, Chat, Kiss, Cover mouth, Look back, Inspect Hip: Sit on leg Feet: Walk towards, Step on foot, Chase, Dance, Kick Action2Motion Text2Motion Actions Texts Inter-X Motion2Text Reaction Generation Motion2Action Stylized Generation Interaction Order Relationship & Personality Personality Assessment Causal Order Inference [Actor]: Pushing [Reactor]:Leaning forward (a) Familiarity Level (b) Human-human Relationship (c) Big Five Personality Distribution Figure . An overview of the data and task taxonomy of our proposed Inter-X dataset, which is a large-scale human-human interaction MoCap dataset with ∼11K interaction sequences and more than .1M frames. The fine-grained textual descriptions, semantic action categories, interaction order, and relationship and personality annotations allow for categories of downstream tasks.",-3,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P2108.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Xu_Inter-X_Towards_Versatile_Human-Human_Interaction_Analysis_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
