CVPR-2024-P2208,CVPR-2024-A012401,Haoning Wu,shared,3,14,14,"S-Lab for Advanced Intelligence, Nanyang Technological University Institute of Image Communication and Network Engineering, Shanghai Jiao Tong University Sensetime Research Institute for Infocomm Research (I R), Agency for Science, Technology and Research (A*STAR), Fusionopolis Way, Singapore Q (a) LLaVA-v1. -7B Which part of the image is clear, without motion blur? Answer with the option's letter from the given choices directly. A. The trees B. The head of the children C. The ground C Rate the quality of the image. Think step by step. Wrong B The image is a close-up of a hot dog on a grill, with the grill being the main focus. The hot dog is placed on a grill pan, and there are several hot dogs on the grill, making it a total of ﬁve hot dogs. The grill is placed on a dining table, which is the background of the image. The overall quality of the image is good, as it captures the details of the hot dogs and the grill pan, providing a clear view of the scene. Correct How ↑Qualitative Comparison What . % . % . % (b) LLaVA-v1. -7B (Q-Instruct) ←Quantitative Results . % The overall clarity of this image is acceptable. The main subject, the sausage, retains most of its texture details. The background table and the lighting are somewhat blurry, with some noticeable noise. Therefore, the quality of this image is considered average. (Radar Map, on LLVisionQA-test) . % Other . % . % . % . % Irrelevant Reasoning Inaccurate Rating Accurate Rating (a) LLaVA-v1. -7B (b) LLaVA-v1. -7B (Q-Instruct) . % Distortion Legend Random (dot in the center) Yes-or-No LLaVA-v1. -7B LLaVA-v1. -7B (Q-Instruct) (Continued) Which is the darkest corner of the image? . % . % (b) LLaVA-v1. -7B (Q-Instruct) (a) LLaVA-v1. -7B . % In-context Distortion . % . % . % In-context Other Overall The darkest corner of the image is the upper left corner, where the hot dog is placed on the grill pan. Answering Multi-Choice Questions (MCQ) related to Low-level Visual Perception The darkest corner of the image is the lower left corner. Reasoning Quality Evaluation and Multi-turn Conversation Figure . Abilities of Q-Instruct-tuned LLaVA-v1. -7B [",1,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P2208.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Wu_Q-Instruct_Improving_Low-level_Visual_Abilities_for_Multi-modality_Foundation_Models_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
