CVPR-2024-P2310,CVPR-2024-A012988,Tong Wu,shared,3,8,8,"Figure . We present a versatile and human-aligned evaluation metric for text-to-3D generative methods. To this end, we design a prompt generator that can produce a set of input prompts targeting an evaluator’s demands. Moreover, we leverage GPT-4V to compare two 3D shapes according to different evaluation criteria. Our method provides a scalable and holistic way to evaluate text-to-3D models.",-4,data/raw/cvpr/2024/first_pages/CVPR-2024-P2310.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/papers/Wu_GPT-4Vision_is_a_Human-Aligned_Evaluator_for_Text-to-3D_Generation_CVPR_2024_paper.pdf
